      "snippet_id": "SNP-001",
      "snippet_text": "> \"As a seller using PayPal, there is a possibility that a client might not be happy with your product/service and that they could dispute the payment. Whilst this is not common, PayPal does provide you and the customer with a system called the Resolution Center to assist both parties.\"\n\n> \"Please be aware that you will only have 30 days to dispute the claim before PayPal will automatically refund the buyer.\"",
